### GET All returns a JSON array.
GET http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos

### GET One returns the requested record.
GET http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos/1

### POST creates a record and returns 201.
POST http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test REST API endpoints",
  "complete": false
}

### PUT modifies an existing record.
PUT http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "Updated DTO REST API",
  "complete": true
}

### DELETE removes a record and returns 204.
DELETE http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos/2

### Requests for nonexistent records return 404 where appropriate.
GET http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos/2

### Invalid data produces an appropriate client-error response.
POST http://localhost:8090/restapi/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "complete": false
}